      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain the thawed strawberries and set aside, reserving juices. In a saucepan bring cornstarch and strawberry juice to a gentle boil. Remove from heat and let cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SLtEo37yHW7pSximGkZZ4c6KcXk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7409-strawberry-torte-VAT-008-step-02_preview-97677ecf334b4581b6567bf0e46b405d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whip cream cheese, sugar, and vanilla together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5kheMTBmXwCLT5NEJ6T6VodyeFo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7409-strawberry-torte-VAT-009-step-03_preview-78c4f4f6d6124407a47f74919f0da32b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl beat whipping cream until stiff peaks form. Fold whipped cream into cream cheese mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QZWu4JDMma1rD0O22JJke7oIsCs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7409-strawberry-torte-VAT-010-step-04_preview-da4c92a7282848f3814d71280c416648.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange ladyfingers around the sides and bottom of an 8-inch springform pan, standing ladyfingers lengthwise around the sides of the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yxlb5t4Qzpp0vpezxfUgdHg62LI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7409-strawberry-torte-VAT-011-step-05_preview-6f21dd36c56c41bdb0c90eb47e6b79b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 1/2 of the filling into the pan, then arrange a layer of ladyfingers on top of the filling. Pour remaining filling over ladyfingers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/trweVzKtVjfJHYHAo6FCb7uuRZE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7409-strawberry-torte-VAT-012-step-06_preview-087175dd47e046bfa0d7f984c4f31f5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7409/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread strawberry sauce over top of cake and arrange whole strawberries on top. Refrigerate overnight until thoroughly chilled.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
